                      "context": "listing",
                      "id": null,
                      "inlines": [
                        {
                          "kind": "text",
                          "value": "Person person = client.get().uri(\"/person/{id}\", i).retrieve()\n\t.bodyToMono(Person.class)\n\t.block();\n\nList<Person> persons = client.get().uri(\"/persons\").retrieve()\n\t.bodyToFlux(Person.class)\n\t.collectList()\n\t.block();"
                        }
                      ],
                      "language": "java",
                      "roles": [],
                      "title": null
                    }
                  ],
                  "checkbox": null,
                  "inlines": []
                },
                "terms": [
                  [
                    {
                      "kind": "text",
                      "value": "Java"
                    }
                  ]
                ]
              },
              {
                "description": {
                  "blocks": [
                    {
                      "context": "listing",
                      "id": null,
                      "inlines": [
                        {
                          "kind": "text",
                          "value": "val person = runBlocking {\n\tclient.get().uri(\"/person/{id}\", i).retrieve()\n\t\t\t.awaitBody<Person>()\n}\n\nval persons = runBlocking {\n\tclient.get().uri(\"/persons\").retrieve()\n\t\t\t.bodyToFlow<Person>()\n\t\t\t.toList()\n}"
                        }
                      ],
                      "language": "kotlin",
                      "roles": [],
                      "title": null
                    }
                  ],
                  "checkbox": null,
                  "inlines": []
                },
                "terms": [
                  [
                    {
                      "kind": "text",
                      "value": "Kotlin"
                    }
                  ]
                ]
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          }
        ],
        "context": "example",
        "id": null,
        "roles": [],
        "title": null
      },
      {
        "context": "paragraph",
        "id": null,
        "inlines": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "However if multiple calls need to be made, it’s more efficient to avoid blocking on each response individually, and instead wait for the combined result:"
          }
        ],
        "roles": [],
        "title": null
      },
      {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "context": "dlist",
            "id": null,
            "items": [
              {
                "description": {
                  "blocks": [
                    {
                      "context": "listing",
                      "id": null,
                      "inlines": [
                        {
                          "kind": "text",
                          "value": "Mono<Person> personMono = client.get().uri(\"/person/{id}\", personId)\n\t\t.retrieve().bodyToMono(Person.class);\n\nMono<List<Hobby>> hobbiesMono = client.get().uri(\"/person/{id}/hobbies\", personId)\n\t\t.retrieve().bodyToFlux(Hobby.class).collectList();\n\nMap<String, Object> data = Mono.zip(personMono, hobbiesMono, (person, hobbies) -> {\n\t\t\tMap<String, String> map = new LinkedHashMap<>();\n\t\t\tmap.put(\"person\", person);\n\t\t\tmap.put(\"hobbies\", hobbies);\n\t\t\treturn map;\n\t\t})\n\t\t.block();"
                        }
                      ],
                      "language": "java",
                      "roles": [],
                      "title": null
                    }
                  ],
                  "checkbox": null,
                  "inlines": []
                },
                "terms": [
                  [
                    {
                      "kind": "text",
                      "value": "Java"
                    }
                  ]
                ]
              },
              {
                "description": {
                  "blocks": [
                    {
                      "context": "listing",
                      "id": null,
                      "inlines": [
                        {
                          "kind": "text",
                          "value": "val data = runBlocking {\n\t\tval personDeferred = async {\n\t\t\tclient.get().uri(\"/person/{id}\", personId)\n\t\t\t\t\t.retrieve().awaitBody<Person>()\n\t\t}\n\n\t\tval hobbiesDeferred = async {\n\t\t\tclient.get().uri(\"/person/{id}/hobbies\", personId)\n\t\t\t\t\t.retrieve().bodyToFlow<Hobby>().toList()\n\t\t}\n\n\t\tmapOf(\"person\" to personDeferred.await(), \"hobbies\" to hobbiesDeferred.await())\n\t}"
                        }
                      ],
                      "language": "kotlin",
                      "roles": [],
                      "title": null
                    }
                  ],
                  "checkbox": null,
                  "inlines": []
                },
                "terms": [
                  [
                    {
                      "kind": "text",
                      "value": "Kotlin"
                    }
                  ]
                ]
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          }
        ],
        "context": "example",
        "id": null,
        "roles": [],
        "title": null
      },
      {
        "context": "paragraph",
        "id": null,
        "inlines": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "The above is merely one example. There are lots of other patterns and operators for putting together a reactive pipeline that makes many remote calls, potentially some nested, interdependent, without ever blocking until the end."
          }
        ],
        "roles": [],
        "title": null
      },
      {
